drm/amd/pm/si: Check AMD_IS_MOBILITY flag for PPSMC_SYSTEMFLAG_GPIO_DC
Backport of Timur Kristof's upstream commit cd883d0a3937 (mainline 7.3-rc6, Cc: stable; not in 7.2.9). The D700's
VBIOS sets HARDWAREDC and defines a 300/150 MHz battery state; without this the SMC stays on the lowest clocks.
Drop this patch once the 7.2.x stable release in use contains cd883d0a3937.

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/pm/legacy-dpm/si_dpm.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/pm/legacy-dpm/si_dpm.c
index 620deb8..ada8ffa 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/pm/legacy-dpm/si_dpm.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/amd/pm/legacy-dpm/si_dpm.c
@@ -5239,7 +5239,8 @@ static int si_init_smc_table(struct amdgpu_device *adev)
 		break;
 	}
 
-	if (adev->pm.dpm.platform_caps & ATOM_PP_PLATFORM_CAP_HARDWAREDC)
+	if ((adev->flags & AMD_IS_MOBILITY) &&
+	    (adev->pm.dpm.platform_caps & ATOM_PP_PLATFORM_CAP_HARDWAREDC))
 		table->systemFlags |= PPSMC_SYSTEMFLAG_GPIO_DC;
 
 	if (adev->pm.dpm.platform_caps & ATOM_PP_PLATFORM_CAP_REGULATOR_HOT) {
